---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Accessibility"
  description="Accessibility commitment and feedback information for farish.dev."
>
  <section class="page page-narrow">
    <p class="eyebrow">Accessibility</p>
    <h1>Accessibility at farish.dev</h1>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        I want farish.dev to be usable by as many people as possible, including people who use
        assistive technologies, keyboard navigation, screen readers, magnification, or reduced-motion
        settings.
      </p>

      <h2>Accessibility standard</h2>
      <p>
        This site is designed and maintained with the goal of meeting the Web Content Accessibility
        Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 Level AA. WCAG provides testable guidance for making web content more
        perceivable, operable, understandable, and robust.
      </p>

      <p>
        I also review the site with applicable disability-access requirements in mind, including the
        Americans with Disabilities Act and California civil-rights protections. Because accessibility
        depends on both code and content, it is an ongoing process rather than a one-time certification.
      </p>

      <h2>Measures used on this site</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Semantic headings, landmarks, links, and navigation.</li>
        <li>A keyboard-accessible skip link and visible keyboard focus indicators.</li>
        <li>Text and interface colors selected for sufficient contrast.</li>
        <li>Responsive layouts that support browser zoom and narrow screens.</li>
        <li>Reduced-motion support for people who request it in their operating system or browser.</li>
        <li>Descriptive link text and text alternatives for meaningful non-text content when used.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Feedback</h2>
      <p>
        If you encounter an accessibility barrier on this site, please let me know through
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/farishkash/">my LinkedIn profile</a>. Please include the
        page address and a short description of the problem so I can investigate it.
      </p>

      <p>Last reviewed: September 27, 2026.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
